/-!
# Mathieu preliminaries for Chapter 16

Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004, 16.1.5(4)–(7) and
16.1.6–8, printed pp.1171–1173.

The completed results give the exact Q₈ * Q₈ kernel and S₃ quotient for the
marked M₁₂ involution centralizer, and innerness for arbitrary two-elements
fixing a Sylow two-subgroup pointwise in the actual M₁₂ and M₂₄ models.
The quaternion-kernel branch has no components; the exact M₁₂ table, once
proved, implies the strict Sylow fixed-point index bound needed in 16.1.8.

`Statements` records the full remaining tables with exact kernels, actual
quotient models and all inner/outer alternatives. Exhaustive table coverage,
the component identifications and exclusions for the remaining branches,
and the M₂₂/M₂₃ Sylow-centralizing calculations are not asserted here.
-/
